            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Mike Paynter, a nurse consultant in urgent care at a Somerset trust, set up a telemedicine service in 2008 that gives clinicians at major injuries units access to fast, expert interpretation of ECG results. The service prevents an estimated 900 acute admissions a year.</AbstractText>
